re you, sir?... What do you want?...","mode":"prose-faithful","notes":[]}},{"id":"ammaiyappan-en-s050-u004","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","target_language":"en","scene_id":"ammaiyappan-s050","archival_scene_ordinal":50,"source":{"source_path":"works/ammaiyappan/dialogues/records/scene-050.json","canonical_scene_path":"works/ammaiyappan/scenes/scene-050.md","source_record_id":"ammaiyappan-s050-d003","source_occurrence_id":null,"source_locator":null,"speaker_label":"வே","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":89,"printed_page":87}],"speaker_label_origin":"source-explicit-colon"},"translation":{"english_text":"Who here is Muthayi?","mode":"prose-faithful","notes":[]}},{"id":"ammaiyappan-en-s050-u005","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","target_language":"en","scene_id":"ammaiyappan-s050","archival_scene_ordinal":50,"source":{"source_path":"works/ammaiyappan/dialogues/records/scene-050.json","canonical_scene_path":"works/ammaiyappan/scenes/scene-050.md","source_record_id":"ammaiyappan-s050-d004","source_occurrence_id":null,"source_locator":null,"speaker_label":"முத்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":89,"printed_page":87}],"speaker_label_origin":"source-explicit-colon"},"translation":{"english_text":"Why!... What is it?","mode":"prose-faithful","notes":[]}},{"id":"ammaiyappan-en-s050-u006","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","target_language":"en","scene_id":"ammaiyappan-s050","archival_scene_ordinal":50,"source":{"source_path":"works/ammaiyappan/dialogues/records/scene-050.json","canonical_scene_path":"works/ammaiyappan/scenes/scene-050.md","source_record_id":"ammaiyappan-s050-d005","source_occurrence_id":null,"source_locator":null,"speaker_label":"வே","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":89,"printed_page":87}],"speaker_label_origin":"source-explicit-colon"},"translation":{"english_text":"Muthan has been attacked by enemies and is in a dying condition.","mode":"prose-faithful","notes":["`மரணவஸ்தை` is translated directly as a dying condition; English does not add medical detail."]}},{"id":"ammaiyappan-en-s050-u007","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","target_language":"en","scene_id":"ammaiyappan-s050","archival_scene_ordinal":50,"source":{"source_path":"works/ammaiyappan/dialogues/records/scene-050.json","canonical_scene_path":"works/ammaiyappan/scenes/scene-050.md","source_record_id":"ammaiyappan-s050-d006","source_occurrence_id":null,"source_locator":null,"speaker_label":"முத்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":89,"printed_page":87}],"speaker_label_origin":"source-explicit-colon"},"translation":{"english_text":"Ah!... Aththan!...","mode":"prose-faithful","notes":["`அத்தான்` is retained as `Aththan` because the kinship/lover address matters to the scene's register."]}},{"id":"ammaiyappan-en-s050-u008","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","target_language":"en","scene_id":"ammaiyappan-s050","archival_scene_ordinal":50,"source":{"source_path":"works/ammaiyappan/dialogues/records/scene-050.json","canonical_scene_path":"works/ammaiyappan/scenes/scene-050.md","source_record_id":"ammaiyappan-s050-d007","source_occurrence_id":null,"source_locator":null,"speaker_label":"வே","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":89,"printed_page":87}],"speaker_label_origin":"source-explicit-colon"},"translation":{"english_text":"Are you Muthayi? If you come with me, you can see him alive...","mode":"prose-faithful","notes":[]}},{"id":"ammaiyappan-en-s050-u009","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","target_language":"en","scene_id":"ammaiyappan-s050","archival_scene_ordinal":50,"source":{"source_path":"works/ammaiyappan/dialogues/records/scene-050.json","canonical_scene_path":"works/ammaiyappan/scenes/scene-050.md","source_record_id":"ammaiyappan-s050-d008","source_occurrence_id":null,"source_locator":null,"speaker_label":"முத்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":89,"printed_page":87}],"speaker_label_origin":"source-explicit-colon"},"translation":{"english_text":"Sir!... Where is he? Take me to him...","mode":"prose-faithful","notes":[]}},{"id":"ammaiyappan-en-s050-u010",